    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40083" root="نعت" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبْدُكَ نُعْتَةٌ</span></b> , or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَتُكَ نُعْتَةٌ</span>, <i>Thy male slave</i> or
<i>thy female slave, is of the highest quality.</i> (K.)
But in the A it is said, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَدُكَ نَعْتٌ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَتُكَ نَعْتَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

